{"id":"a599a2f4a391801b","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-projection-function.md","title":"Projection Function $P i^k$","display":"df-projection-function — Projection Function $P_i^k$","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-projection-function","aliases":["92-df-projection-function"],"display":"df-projection-function — Projection Function $P_i^k$","depends_on":[],"source":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义","source_status":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-projection-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-projection-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-projection-function — Projection Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i^k\">\\(P_i^k\\)</span>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source","html":"原书之外的递归论运算背景；原书第 IV 章附录 pp.53–54 以 Σ1 可定义性规定递归/部分递归，未给出本库这套 PR 算子与 Cantor 配对定义"},{"key":"source_status","html":"外部计算背景的本地运算实现"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\)</span> (arity and index)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P_i^k)_{k\\geq1,\\,1\\leq i\\leq k}\">\\((P_i^k)_{k\\geq1,\\,1\\leq i\\leq k}\\)</span> (definition-target projection family)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\nP_i^k\\coloneqq\\bigl((n_1,\\ldots,n_k)\\mapsto n_i\\bigr):\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\,\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\nP_i^k\\coloneqq\\bigl((n_1,\\ldots,n_k)\\mapsto n_i\\bigr):\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_i^k\">\\(P_i^k\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>元投影函数，返回第<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span>个参数</li>\n<li>投影函数是原始递归的基本函数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_1^1(n) = n\">\\(P_1^1(n) = n\\)</span>（恒等函数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_1^2(n, m) = n\">\\(P_1^2(n, m) = n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_2^2(n, m) = m\">\\(P_2^2(n, m) = m\\)</span></li>\n<li>用于构造更复杂的函数</li>\n<li>在系统G中表示：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{P_i^k}(x_1, \\ldots, x_k, y) \\coloneqq y = x_i\">\\(\\varphi_{P_i^k}(x_1, \\ldots, x_k, y) \\coloneqq y = x_i\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"P_i^k","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}","display":false},{"tex":"(P_i^k)_{k\\geq1,\\,1\\leq i\\leq k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}projection\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}\\,\\forall i\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;\nP_i^k\\coloneqq\\bigl((n_1,\\ldots,n_k)\\mapsto n_i\\bigr):\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N","display":true},{"tex":"P_i^k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"P_1^1(n) = n","display":false},{"tex":"P_1^2(n, m) = n","display":false},{"tex":"P_2^2(n, m) = m","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi_{P_i^k}(x_1, \\ldots, x_k, y) \\coloneqq y = x_i","display":false}],"bytes":1214,"backlinks":[{"id":"736154be0fae643a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P_i^k$ (projection functions, see [[92-df-projection-function]])"},{"id":"6fb25d603f77631d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z,S,P_1^1$ (basic primitive-recursive functions, see [[92-df-zero-function]], [[92-df-successor-function]], [[92-df-projection-function]])"},{"id":"4ead54d85f5ad67d","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P_1^1$ (unary projection, see [[92-df-projection-function]])"},{"id":"893064ec9f8dc7f0","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P_i^k$ (projection, see [[92-df-projection-function]])"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-projection-function]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-130","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-projection-function]]"}],"outgoing":[]}